---------Docker------------
Open Git Bash / Terminal
→ docker logout
→ docker login

→ Create Dockerfile
→ nano Dockerfile
→ Enter Dockerfile contents

For JAR:
→ FROM eclipse-temurin:jdk-17
→ WORKDIR /app.dir
→ COPY target/urfile.jar app.jar
→ CMD ["java","-jar","app.jar"]

For WAR:
→ FROM tomcat:9.0
→ COPY target/urfile.war /usr/local/tomcat/webapps/ROOT.war
→ EXPOSE 8080
→ CMD ["catalina.sh","run"]

→ Ctrl + S
→ Ctrl + X

→ docker build -t smth-app .
→ docker images

For WAR:
→ docker run -d --name some-container -p 7012:8080 smth-app

For JAR:
→ docker run smth-app

→ docker tag smth-app <dockerhub_username>/smth-app
→ docker images
→ docker push <dockerhub_username>/smth-app

If container already exists:
→ docker stop smth-container
→ docker rm smth-container
→ docker ps -a

To remove image:
→ docker rmi smth-app


Common errors:
1)no main manifest error 
fix1:
<plugin>
     <artifactId>maven-jar-plugin</artifactId>
     <configuration>
         <archive>
          <manifest>
            <mainClass>CSMB.CEMS.App</mainClass>
          </manifest>
         </archive>
     </configuration>
</plugin>
add this plugin inside plugins

